# Keep source and fixture checkouts LF on every host. The test suite compares
# generated text against checked-in files and several component tests match
# exact snippets containing newlines; a CRLF working tree otherwise fails only
# on Windows. Windows-native scripts stay CRLF for their consumers.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary artifacts must never be normalised.
*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
